This Privacy Policy describes how valapeji ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and shares information when you use our mobile application, Dog Vision.
1. Information Collection and Use
We do not collect any personally identifiable information (PII) from our users. The app is designed to provide a camera simulation experience without requiring you to create an account or provide personal details.
2. Permissions We Request
To provide the app's core features, we request access to the following:
•
Camera: To provide the real-time dog vision simulation. We do NOT record or store any video or images on our servers.
•
Storage/Gallery: To allow you to save the photos you take within the app to your device's gallery.
3. Third-Party Services (Advertising)
We use third-party advertising services to serve ads within the app. These services may collect information used to identify your device.
•
Google AdMob: Our app uses AdMob to show Banner, Interstitial, Rewarded, and App Open ads. Google may use advertising IDs and other device identifiers to show personalized or non-personalized ads.
